{"title":"Career Roadmap · Renewable Project Assistant","role":"Renewable Project Assistant","summary":"A Renewable Project Assistant supports the planning, execution, documentation, monitoring and coordination of renewable-energy projects such as solar, wind, biomass, small hydro, battery storage and hybrid energy systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Renewable Energy Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a realistic entry-level career for a B.Sc Renewable Energy graduate. The role can serve as a gateway into solar project development, project management, energy analytics, operations, sustainability and renewable-energy consulting."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Engineering-designated roles such as Solar Design Engineer, Electrical Engineer or Power Systems Engineer may require B.E./B.Tech or another specific qualification. A B.Sc graduate should initially target project-assistant, project-coordinator, operations, monitoring, energy-analysis and documentation roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Student / Intern"},{"text":"Renewable-energy fundamentals + project coordination"}],[{"text":"2027–2029"},{"text":"Renewable Project Assistant / Coordinator"},{"text":"Project execution, documentation, site support"}],[{"text":"2029–2032"},{"text":"Project Coordinator / Renewable Energy Analyst"},{"text":"Project planning, procurement, monitoring"}],[{"text":"2032–2036"},{"text":"Project Manager / Senior Energy Analyst"},{"text":"End-to-end project management"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Senior Project Manager / Renewable Energy Specialist"},{"text":"Large-scale renewable projects"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Programme Manager / Renewable Energy Lead"},{"text":"Portfolio strategy, energy transition and investment"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Renewable Project Assistant Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role connects technical teams, project managers, vendors, contractors, customers and management."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supporting renewable project planning"},{"text":"Preparing project documentation"},{"text":"Tracking project milestones"},{"text":"Coordinating with engineering teams"},{"text":"Supporting site surveys"},{"text":"Collecting site information"},{"text":"Monitoring installation progress"},{"text":"Tracking materials and equipment"},{"text":"Coordinating vendors"},{"text":"Maintaining project schedules"},{"text":"Preparing progress reports"},{"text":"Supporting quality checks"},{"text":"Recording project costs"},{"text":"Preparing presentations"},{"text":"Maintaining technical records"},{"text":"Supporting commissioning activities"},{"text":"Analysing project performance data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A project assistant does not necessarily design the complete electrical system. The role is primarily about technical coordination, execution and project control."}]},{"heading":"Renewable Energy Technologies to Understand","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build broad knowledge first."},{"type":"h","text":"Solar"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV"},{"text":"Rooftop solar"},{"text":"Utility-scale solar"},{"text":"Solar thermal"},{"text":"Floating solar"},{"text":"Hybrid solar systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wind"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Onshore wind"},{"text":"Offshore wind"},{"text":"Wind resource assessment"},{"text":"Turbine fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Energy Storage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithium-ion batteries"},{"text":"Battery Energy Storage Systems"},{"text":"Battery management systems"},{"text":"Energy storage economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Technologies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biomass"},{"text":"Biogas"},{"text":"Small hydro"},{"text":"Green hydrogen"},{"text":"Waste-to-energy"},{"text":"Hybrid renewable systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become an expert in every technology. Eventually choose one primary specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Sc","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Energy & Science Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electricity"},{"text":"Magnetism"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Power"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Basic electronics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Renewable Energy"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar energy"},{"text":"Wind energy"},{"text":"Biomass"},{"text":"Hydropower"},{"text":"Energy conversion"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Basic numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Solar Energy Potential Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse solar-energy potential for a selected location using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar irradiation"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Roof/land area"},{"text":"Energy demand"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Solar + Energy Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger technical knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Solar PV"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar cells"},{"text":"PV modules"},{"text":"Inverters"},{"text":"Charge controllers"},{"text":"DC/AC systems"},{"text":"String configuration"},{"text":"Mounting systems"},{"text":"System losses"},{"text":"Solar irradiation"},{"text":"Performance ratio"},{"text":"Capacity factor"},{"text"