ind energy"},{"text":"Energy systems"},{"text":"Renewable technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 2 — M.Sc Energy Science / Energy Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy analysis"},{"text":"Energy management"},{"text":"Renewable project development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 3 — M.Tech Renewable Energy"},{"type":"p","text":"Potentially stronger for advanced technical roles, subject to eligibility requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Option 4 — MBA Energy Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project development"},{"text":"Energy business"},{"text":"Commercial strategy"},{"text":"Renewable investment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 5 — MBA Project Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project Manager"},{"text":"Programme Manager"},{"text":"Renewable infrastructure management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 6 — M.Sc Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent if you want to specialise in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Energy Data Analytics / Renewable Energy Intelligence"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable Energy Engineering"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Management"},{"text":"Sustainable Energy Systems"},{"text":"Energy Management"},{"text":"Energy Economics"},{"text":"Energy Policy"},{"text":"Environmental Management"},{"text":"Climate & Energy"},{"text":"Smart Energy Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Denmark"},{"text":"Sweden"},{"text":"Norway"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility for engineering-focused programmes can vary considerably for B.Sc graduates, so verify each university's mathematics, physics and degree-equivalency requirements."